[6.255923, "o", "\u001b[0;32m\u2713 \u001b[0m.env written (passwords generated, not printed)\r\n\r\n\u001b[0;36m==> \u001b[0mBuilding Mnemodrome from source and starting the stack...\r\n    \u001b[0;36mFirst run pulls the database images (Neo4j, Qdrant, Redis) and compiles\r\n    the memory server, so it can take a few minutes. This is real\r\n    infrastructure being assembled on your machine \u2014 not a mock.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
