[39.889, "o", "\u001b[0;32m\u2713 \u001b[0mMemory layers warmed; install recorded (2026-07-02T02:31:31Z)\r\n\r\n\u001b[0;36m==> \u001b[0mMemory layer status:\r\n    \u001b[0;32m\u2713\u001b[0m Graph (Neo4j)        connected\r\n    \u001b[0;32m\u2713\u001b[0m Vector (Qdrant)      connected\r\n    \u001b[0;32m\u2713\u001b[0m Cache (Redis)        connected\r\n"]
[39.889, "o", "    \u001b[0;32m\u2713\u001b[0m Event Log            connected\r\n    \u001b[0;32m\u2713\u001b[0m LLM (ollama)         http://localhost:11434 (gemma3:4b-it-qat / nomic-embed-text)\r\n\r\n\u001b[0;36m==> \u001b[0mContainer status:\r\n"]
[39.988, "o", "NAME                    IMAGE                   COMMAND                  SERVICE      CREATED          STATUS                             PORTS\r\nmnemodrome-mcp-server   mnemodrome-mcp-server   \"python -m src.mcp_s\u2026\"   mcp-server   56 seconds ago   Up 24 seconds (health: starting)   8083/tcp, 0.0.0.0:8765->8765/tcp, [::]:8765->8765/tcp\r\nmnemodrome-neo4j        neo4j:5.26-community    \"tini -g -- /startup\u2026\"   neo4j        56 seconds ago   Up 55 seconds (healthy)            127.0.0.1:7474->7474/tcp, 7473/tcp, 127.0.0.1:7687->7687/tcp\r\nmnemodrome-qdrant       qdrant/qdrant:v1.18.2   \"./entrypoint.sh\"        qdrant       56 seconds ago   Up 55 seconds (healthy)            127.0.0.1:6333-6334->6333-6334/tcp\r\nmnemodrome-redis        redis:7-alpine          \"docker-entrypoint.s\u2026\"   redis        56 seconds ago   Up 55 seconds (healthy)            127.0.0.1:6379->6379/tcp\r\n"]
[39.992, "o", "\r\n\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\n\u001b[0;32m\u001b[1m  \u2705  Mnemodrome v1.0.0 is LIVE and remembering.\u001b[0m\r\n\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\n\r\n  MCP endpoint : \u001b[0;36mhttp://localhost:8765/mcp\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[39.992, "o", "  Health check : \u001b[0;36mhttp://localhost:8765/health\u001b[0m\r\n  Data root    : \u001b[0;36m/opt/mnemodrome/data\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  Deep verification (recommended) \u2014 full MCP handshake + live tool round-trip:\r\n    \u001b[1muv run python scripts/verify_deployment.py\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[39.992, "o", "    uv is how we run Python \u2014 fast, reproducible, the modern standard.\r\n    Don't have it? One line:  curl -LsSf https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh | sh\r\n    Docs: https://docs.astral.sh/uv/\r\n\r\n"]
[39.992, "o", "  To stop:    docker compose down\r\n  To start:   docker compose up -d\r\n  To rebuild: docker compose up -d --build\r\n"]
